            "  True Negatives:  1065 (67.0%)\n",
            "  False Positives: 155 (9.7%) - False alarms\n",
            "  False Negatives: 218 (13.7%) - Missed cases\n",
            "  → Model is too conservative (missing too many sepsis cases)\n",
            "\n",
            "6-hour prediction (threshold=0.5):\n",
            "  True Positives:  176 (11.1%)\n",
            "  True Negatives:  1056 (66.4%)\n",
            "  False Positives: 164 (10.3%) - False alarms\n",
            "  False Negatives: 194 (12.2%) - Missed cases\n",
            "  → Model is too conservative (missing too many sepsis cases)\n"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "source": [
        "analyze_errors(main_results,threshold=0.5)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "id": "TeBtyjIlM317",
      "metadata": {
        "id": "TeBtyjIlM317"
      },
      "source": [
        "All models show conservative behavior:\n",
        "- **False Negative Rate**: 12-14% (missed sepsis cases)\n",
        "- **False Positive Rate**: ~10% (false alarms)\n",
        "- **Clinical Implication**: Models err on the side of caution\n",
        "\n",
        "The 6-hour prediction model achieves the best balance with 11.1% true positives vs 9.6-9.8% for shorter horizons."
      ]
    },
