      "source": [
        "### 2.1 Leave-One-Feature-Out Ablation\n",
        "\n",
        "Ablation analysis is helpful to understand which biomarkers to monitor most closely by omitting featues and measure the effect on a models prediction abilities.\n",
        "\n",
        "A systematic ablation analysis was performed by retraining models while omitting one feature at a time. The drop in AUC (ΔAUC) was used to assess the importance of each feature."
      ]
    },
